  "nameEn": "Fork with Lights",
  "descriptionNightEn": "Walk the path for 8 steps. At bends try right first, then left. Repair sparking lamps and light them, light the dark ones and leave the shining ones.",
  "descriptionEn": "The path winds between trees and the edge of the field, with lamps in different states: dark, sparking and already shining.",
  "descriptionDayEn": "Walk the path for 8 steps. At bends try right first, then left. Only repair sparking lamps and turn off the shining ones."
